{
  "slug": "rudder-cli",
  "name": "Rudder Cli",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Workflows for driving the rudder-cli and rudder-typer CLIs: validate, dry-run, apply, import, transformations.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (5): `rudder-cli-setup` (Installs and authenticates rudder-cli), `rudder-cli-workflow` (Validates, previews, and applies RudderStack resource changes via YAML specs), `rudder-import-and-evolve` (Imports existing RudderStack workspace resources into YAML files for git-based management), `rudder-transformations` (Creates and manages RudderStack transformations and libraries with local testing), `rudder-typer-workflow` (Generates type-safe SDKs (Swift/Kotlin) from tracking plans with compile-time validation)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install rudder-cli@claude-community` from `rudderlabs/rudder-agent-skills` (`plugins/rudder-cli`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
